        "textBody": "=🎉 Congratulations! Your appointment at Westhill Nails & Spa is confirmed! ✨\\n\\n💅 Service: {{ $json.data.service_name }}\\n📅 Date: {{ $json.data.appointment_date }}\\n🕒 Time: {{ $json.data.appointment_time }}\\n💳 Payment: Cash (Pending)\\n📍 Address: Westhill Nails Salon\\n\\nSee you soon! 🌸",
